{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45684","headline":"送崔使君 · 贯休","name":"送崔使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳门柳门，芳草芊绵。\n日日日日，黯然黯然。\n子牟恋阙归阙，王粲下楼相别。\n食实得地，颇淹岁月。\n今朝天子在上，合雪必雪。\n况绦之牧，文行炳洁。\n释谓缘因，久昵清尘。\n王嘉迎安，远狎遗民。\n嫓彼二子，厥或相似。\n论文不文，话道无滓。\n士有贵逼，势不可遏。\n麟步规矩，凤翥昂枿。\n岘首仁踪项频跋，商云乳麝香可撮。\n望尘□□连紫闼，吾皇必用整乾坤，莫忘江头白头达。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}